[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

; NOT CONTENT. A neutral technical fixture for the room-contract
; conformance suite, and the first authored room in the project with
; THREE doorways. `shell_room_honest.tscn` is its two-door parent and
; the geometry is otherwise identical: the left wall is split into two
; 6.8 m segments leaving a 2.4 m opening centred at z = 8, and the
; balcony moves to the RIGHT wall so it does not hang across it.
;
; It exists because multi-door composition was proved on the PROCEDURAL
; producer alone -- `procedural_sockets` declares four openings and
; `cut_plan` carves them -- while the authored producer had no door plan
; at all. A shell with three declared doorways is what makes that half
; measurable, and it needs no art-lane asset to exist.
;
; 12 x 6 x 16 m, every wall inside the declared envelope.
